# UoP / B2B Calculator (this repo)

## Stack

- **App:** single `index.html` at repo root (large inline CSS + JS). **Vite** wraps it for dev/build (`npm run dev`, `npm run build` → `dist/`).
- **Deploy:** GitHub Actions deploys to **GitHub Pages** at `https://citizenrun.github.io/UoPB2BCalculator/` (production build must use `base` `/UoPB2BCalculator/` — see `.github/workflows/deploy-pages.yml`).

## When editing

- Prefer **small, focused diffs** in `index.html`; match existing patterns for i18n (`T.en` / `T.pl`, `applyLang` ids) and B2B (`JOB_RULES`, `searchJobRules`, `selectB2bJobRule`).
- After logic or UI changes that affect payroll or B2B job matching: run **`npm run build`** and **`npm test`** (Playwright smoke in `tests/smoke.spec.js`).
- **Domain knowledge** (formulas, calibration, PKWiU notes): read `.cursor/skills/uop-kalkulator/SKILL.md` first for UoP + B2B context.

## Do not

- Commit secrets, `.env`, or personal payslip data into the public repo.
- Change `vite.config.js` `base` without aligning **deploy workflow** and **Pages URL** (project site lives under `/UoPB2BCalculator/`).
